{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國天團Big Bang正舉行慶祝出道20周年的世界巡唱，他們7日和8日一連兩晚在泰國曼谷拉加曼加拉國家體育場開騷，全球歌迷歡喜若狂。</p><p>不過今晚卻發生不快事，演唱會期間一直下着滂沱大雨，雖然成員們相當專業地發揮超水準表現，但最終敵不過相當惡劣</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.596226+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T13:26:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_hash":"d8895075ae38b9bc0db4619b33afe8d15879a3429190aa1106ed9f9df4e4117d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}